  "text": "Range request fix deployed and verified on cdn.divine.video:\n- Range requests now bypass worker cache (x-cache-status: MISS each time)\n- Non-range requests still use worker cache correctly (MISS then HIT)\n- This fixes video seeking/scrubbing in iOS/Android players\n\nThe worker correctly returns 206 Partial Content with proper Content-Range headers.\n\nTest scripts created:\n- test_range_requests.sh - basic testing\n- verify_fix.sh - comprehensive verification (all tests passing)\n\nNext: May want to test with an actual video file to verify end-to-end behavior in a video player.",
